    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You gain a state of heightened power.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You remain in this state of heightened power once you enter it.</p><p><strong>Duration</strong> 1 minute or until you discharge.</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You channel etheric motes of your aspect around you. In this state, you can channel the aspect through your weapon and body. While in this form, you emit a glow of dim light up to 5 feet, and you can perform High Jump and Long Jump actions with Acrobatics and Tumble Through and Maneuver in Flight with Athletics.</span></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.YuGGBsR7zotqRx7C]{Stance: Storm Surge Stance}</p>",
